The original blue 32x24 pixel PNG and 0.01-second silent PCM WAV in this
folder are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
They were generated as deterministic local conformance fixtures; no
third-party media is included.

input.jpeg, input.webp and input.flac are FFmpeg-derived encodings of those
same original fixtures, also dedicated under CC0-1.0. Regeneration logic is
in scripts/generate_media_fixtures.kujo; no downloaded media is used.
